        <item>
            <title>1.1.75</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Download lectures consecutively: the download action stays available after a completed run, and selecting new days resets the finished state.</li><li>Right-click an unanswered quiz choice to strike it out; right-click again to restore it.</li><li>In-lecture quizzes open in a separate window that can be moved by its title bar or inside edge.</li><li>Reduce repeated Keychain prompts: stop automatic retries after declined or unavailable access, and retry explicitly with Unlock saved credentials in Settings. macOS may still request permission for existing saved credentials after updates.</li><li>Fix narrow-window clipping and use the nine original loading animations with complete, smooth repeat cycles throughout the app.</li></ul>]]></description>
